Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.41,0:04:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In Japan, it stored and maintained the equipment for
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.37,0:04:11.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}a 992 bed deployable hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:15.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 2012, about 200 soldiers of the 325th Combat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.25,0:04:18.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Support Hospital, from Missouri, set up medical
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.83,0:04:20.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}tents there for an exercise.
