Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:03.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In less than a week, it had a full hospital:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:06.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}emergency services, surgery, two intensive care
