Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.51,0:07:22.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}with 44 beds for patients needing intensive care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.03,0:07:23.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Running 24 hours a day.
