Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:53.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At first, it took patients without COVID-19, to take
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:55.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}pressure off the city's hospitals.
