Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:55.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}systems and parking garages for safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:58.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So the Army is practicing hospitals that can hide.
